title: “Are Saved” or “Being Saved”? 1 Corinthians 1:18 and 15:2
description: Why the King James Bible renders σῳζομένοις “are saved” in 1 Corinthians 1:18 and 15:2, and why “are being saved” risks implying an unfinished or losable salvation.
output: lessons/doctrine/doctrine-week-4-are-saved-or-being-saved.html

